<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S2.F4.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure S4</span>: </span><span id="S2.F4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Qualitative comparison of Ours (column 5) and Baseline (column 2<math id="S2.F4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sim" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>∼</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sim</annotation></semantics></math>4)</span></figcaption>
